{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05853","headline":"送魏郡李太守赴任 · 王维","name":"送魏郡李太守赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君伯氏别，又欲与君离。\n君行无几日，当复隔山陂。\n苍茫秦川尽，日落桃林塞。\n独树临关门，黄河向天外。\n前经洛阳陌，宛洛故人稀。\n故人离别尽，淇上转骖騑。\n企予悲送远，惆怅睢阳路。\n古木官渡平，秋城邺宫故。\n想君行县日，其出从如云。\n遥思魏公子，复忆李将军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}